## Two Operating Modes

**Local mode:** Full features including optional Ollama. Docker Compose. No paid services required.

**Hosted portfolio mode** (`HOSTED_MODE=true`): Ollama disabled. Write operations restricted. Precomputed ML data deployed as fixtures. No personal data exposed. Near-zero hosting cost.

All new features must behave correctly in both modes.

